MyGo patch 0018: accept local files offered only as public.url.

A native drag can offer a file URL without the file-list type Finder also
provides. The legacy OnFileDrop fallback rejected that drag during negotiation,
so native panels never received the file. Accept URI-list drags as file
candidates and read both representations on drop; Data.Files still rejects
remote URLs. TestContentWindowFileURLDrop covers the native hook before and after.
diff --git a/content.go b/content.go
